From edc7e042f431fb5683036ca1537578741260e7d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpv-ht development <development@mpv-ht.local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:32:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] video: add persistent gpu-next thumbnail renderer

Keep a Vulkan/libplacebo offscreen renderer alive across thumbnail seeks, accept explicit SDR or BT.2020/PQ targets, and preserve Dolby metadata through the normal gpu-next reconstruction path. Use a static Spline curve driven by maxRGB and apply it along a linear RGB ray for the thumbnail color map.
---
